      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need you to run a feasibility report on a new operational directive. the board is looking at moving away from this central architecture and transitioning to a decentralized model using 50 localized nodes for regional logistics. i need you to map out how we'd phase out the central engine and what the pros/cons would be for the transition period.",
