      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i noticed you mentioned 'initial disruption' as a con. can you get more specific? i'm worried about the actual numbers. if we actually pull the plug on the central engine and switch to these 50 nodes, what does the projected impact on medication delivery timelines and supply chain stability look like over the first 90 days? give me a detailed breakdown of the risks.",
